# Umami analytics.
#
# PRODUCTION values live as GitHub Actions repository *variables*, not here:
#   PUBLIC_UMAMI_URL = https://cloud.umami.is
#   PUBLIC_UMAMI_ID  = 02444f2b-b213-4fbc-983b-078a96a29a4b
#
# Do NOT create a .env with these values. Astro auto-loads .env, so leaving
# one in place bakes it into every local build and pollutes production stats
# with your own dev traffic.
#
# One-off local test instead:
#   PUBLIC_UMAMI_URL=https://cloud.umami.is PUBLIC_UMAMI_ID=<id> npm run build
